    "title": "<p class=\"TableTitle\"><strong>Table&nbsp;2.01</strong> The Vienna and Reid classifications of dysplasia in Barrett oesophagus</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "Odze RD",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 460.7pt; border-collapse: collapse; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" border=\"0\" width=\"614\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 269.35pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" width=\"359\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Vienna</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 191.35pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"255\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210035160;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Reid</span></strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 269.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" width=\"359\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210035160;\">Negative for neoplasia/dysplasia</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 191.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"255\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210035160;\">Negative for dysplasia</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 269.35pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" width=\"359\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210035160;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Indefinite for neoplasia/dysplasia</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 191.35pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"255\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210035160;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Indefinite for dysplasia</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 269.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" width=\"359\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210035160;\">Non-invasive low-grade neoplasia (low-grade adenoma/dysplasia)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 191.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"255\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210035160;\">Low-grade dysplasia</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 4; page-break-inside: avoid; height: 20.6pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 269.35pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 20.6pt;\" colspan=\"2\" width=\"359\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210035160;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Non-invasive high-grade neoplasia</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 191.35pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 20.6pt;\" rowspan=\"2\" width=\"255\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210035160;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">High-grade dysplasia</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 5; page-break-inside: avoid; height: 37.55pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.3pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 37.55pt;\" width=\"28\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210035160;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 248.05pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 37.55pt;\" width=\"331\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210035160;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">High-grade dysplasia</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210035160;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Non-invasive carcinoma (carcinoma in&nbsp;situ)</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210035160;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Suspicious for invasive carcinoma</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 6; page-break-inside: avoid; height: 24.55pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 269.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 24.55pt;\" colspan=\"2\" width=\"359\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210035160;\">Invasive neoplasia</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 191.35pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 24.55pt;\" rowspan=\"2\" width=\"255\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210035160;\">Adenocarcinoma</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210035160;\">Intramucosal adenocarcinoma</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210035160;\">Invasive adenocarcinoma</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 7; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid; height: 16.0pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.3pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 16.0pt;\" width=\"28\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210035160;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 248.05pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 16.0pt;\" width=\"331\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210035160;\">Intramucosal adenocarcinoma</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210035160;\">Submucosal carcinoma or beyond</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>",
