    "fileId": 44765,
    "type": "Figure",
    "diagnosis": "Barrett dysplasia",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "Low-grade, foveolar type. The dysplastic epithelium shows mildly to moderately enlarged, hyperchromatic, round to oval nuclei, with slight stratification and an increased number of mitoses but no goblet cells; the cytoplasm is mucinous.",
    "source": "",
    "copyright": "Odze RD",
    "tablehtml": "",
