    "type": "Figure",
    "diagnosis": "Barrett dysplasia",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "High-grade, foveolar type. Markedly atypical epithelium composed of enlarged, hyperchromatic, elongated, irregularly shaped nuclei, with pleomorphism, full-thickness stratification, loss of polarity, and increased number of mitoses; the cytoplasm is mucinous but somewhat depleted.",
